   "content": [
    {
     "text": "It specifies a digital radio standard for the European railways. It forms part of the specification for technical interoperability. It encompasses ground-train voice and data communications, together with the groundbased mobile communications needs of trackside workers, station and depot staff and railway administrative and managerial personnel.",
     "role": "background"
